1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,128
Welcome to the Drone Threat Simulator.

2
00:00:03,078 --> 00:00:05,592
Start by choosing a mission.

3
00:00:05,592 --> 00:00:08,907
Civilian Tracking has three targets.

4
00:00:08,907 --> 00:00:12,592
Mixed Airspace adds a military aircraft.

5
00:00:12,592 --> 00:00:16,342
Full Threat Response includes all six drones.

6
00:00:16,342 --> 00:00:22,368
In the field, move with W, A, S, and D, and aim with your mouse.

7
00:00:22,368 --> 00:00:27,092
Center the crosshair on a drone and press F, or click Lock Aim.

8
00:00:27,092 --> 00:00:29,947
Keep it centered for ten seconds.

9
00:00:29,947 --> 00:00:33,263
If your aim slips, the lock resets.

10
00:00:33,263 --> 00:00:35,763
The drone will be brought down.

11
00:00:35,763 --> 00:00:39,342
You then have ten seconds to identify it.

12
00:00:39,342 --> 00:00:44,355
Check the airframe and signature, then choose Civilian or Military.

13
00:00:44,355 --> 00:00:48,855
You can also press J for Civilian or K for Military.

14
00:00:48,855 --> 00:00:52,039
Correct calls earn one hundred points.

15
00:00:52,039 --> 00:00:54,644
Wrong calls cost fifty.

16
00:00:54,644 --> 00:00:58,039
If time runs out, the drone escapes.

17
00:00:58,039 --> 00:01:01,723
Identify every target to complete the mission.

18
00:01:01,723 --> 00:01:03,328
Good luck.

